          "description": "ASTEM tape, chem_opt = 170 column, model step 60, level 1: T = 304.72 K, relative humidity 0.4886 (relhumclm from dumps/chem170_mosaic_astem). The real64 constants ASTEM held after update_thermodynamic_constants (AIN record). rel 1e-9.",
